actor Developer
participant "Git Repository\n(Versioned Source)" as Git
participant "Pinned Docker Image\nflutter_rust_env:latest" as Image
participant "CI Pipeline\n(Jenkinsfile)" as CI
participant "Ephemeral Workspace" as WS
participant "Persistent Cache" as Cache

Developer -> Git : Push commit
CI -> Git : Clone specific branch
CI -> Image : Use pinned image version
Image -> WS : Execute build
WS -> Cache : Resolve dependencies

note right of Image
Toolchains are versioned:
- Flutter X.Y.Z
- Dart X.Y.Z
- Rust X.Y.Z
- Android SDK
- Android NDK 28.2.13676358
end note

note right of WS
Workspace recreated every build.
No residual state.
end note

note right of Cache
Only dependency cache.
Can be cleaned (Deep Clean).
Does not contain source.
end note

CI -> Developer : Deterministic APK/AAB output

@enduml